{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04679","headline":"卢巴驿闻张御史张判官欲到不得待留赠之 · 张说","name":"卢巴驿闻张御史张判官欲到不得待留赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅窜南方远，传闻北使来。\n旧庭知玉树，合浦识珠胎。\n白发因愁改，丹心托梦廻。\n皇恩若再造，爲忆不然灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}